(NovaTech Corp Employee Handbook - Page 2: Paid Time Off & Parental Leave) Tj T*
(4. Annual Paid Time Off \(PTO\): Employees accrue 22 days of PTO per calendar year.) Tj T*
(Up to 5 unused PTO days may roll over to Q1 of the following year; excess days expire March 31.) Tj T*
(5. Parental Leave: Primary and secondary caregivers receive 16 weeks of 100% paid parental leave) Tj T*
(available within 12 months of birth, adoption, or foster placement.) Tj T*
(6. Sabbatical Benefit: After 5 consecutive years of full-time service, employees qualify for) Tj T*
(a 4-week paid sabbatical approved at least 60 days in advance.) Tj T*
